Subject: [PATCH 02/14] Accept registered creature subtypes in the subtype
 lexicon (Restless Prairie)

collect_valid_subtypes now includes oracle_subtypes(), so animation-only
subtypes such as Llama are not flagged as parser misfires. CR 205.3m.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
